# Where "Open The App" points while developing.
#
# The unified dev server (`npm run dev`, tools/dev-all.mjs) serves apps/web under
# /app/ on the same origin as this page, so the dev link and the deployed default
# now agree on the path and differ only in the fragment: #/case is the worked
# example, not the About tab, because someone arriving from the landing page has
# just read what the thing is.
#
# Committed on purpose: it holds no secret.
# QUOTED, and it has to be: dotenv treats an unquoted `#` as the start of a
# comment, so the bare form silently loses the `#/case` fragment and the button
# lands on the app's default route instead of the worked example.
VITE_APP_URL="/app/#/case"
